OL,3,ASpanish transport minister resigns days
OL,4,Aafter deadly train crash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A transport minister in a country like
OL,7,FSpain cannot remain in office after two
OL,8,Faccidents of this seriousness in less
OL,9,Fthan a year," he said - a reference to
OL,10,FJanuary's crash on the same line which
OL,11,Fleft 46 people dead.
OL,13,FLast week's crash was one of the worst
OL,14,Frail disasters in Europe's modern
OL,15,Fhistory, and Spain's worst crash since
OL,16,F2013.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
