OL,3,ASeven flights across Europe targeted by
OL,4,Asuspected bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile officially there is no link
OL,7,Fbetween them, authorities from various
OL,8,Fcountries will be co-operating to
OL,9,Fassess whether this was a co-ordinated
OL,10,Fattack, designed to disrupt airspace.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
