OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABinance says fake job interviews used
OL,4,Aas part of $6.3bn crypto hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said they used a range of techniques
OL,7,Fsuch as malicious software downloads to
OL,8,Fcompromise the computers of Binance
OL,9,Fengineers and gain control over tools
OL,10,Fto drain its wallet of billions of
OL,11,Fdollars worth of crypto.
OL,13,FBinance called it a "serious and highly
OL,14,Fsophisticated security incident" and
OL,15,Fapologised, saying "this should not
OL,16,Fhave happened".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
